於齊，立之，是爲衛文公。文公女弟爲桓公夫人。秦穆公即位。三十年，桓公病，太子茲甫讓其庶兄目夷爲嗣。桓公義太子意，竟不聽。三十一年春，桓公卒，太子茲甫立，是爲襄公。以其庶兄目夷爲相。未葬，而齊桓公會諸矦于葵丘，襄公往會。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m035-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001647","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m035-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"諸矦","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"泛稱、政制、群體、神異、匿名者或未定指代；不補未見人名、闕代、制度爵等或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m035-0018","start":18,"end":21,"surface":"齊桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000235","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m035-0030","start":30,"end":34,"surface":"衛公子燬","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001563","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m035-0042","start":42,"end":45,"surface":"衛文公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001563","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m035-0046","start":46,"end":48,"surface":"文公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001563","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m035-0048","start":48,"end":50,"surface":"女弟","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001649","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m035-0051","start":51,"end":53,"surface":"桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001647","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m035-0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"夫人","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001649","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m035-0056","start":56,"end":59,"surface":"秦穆公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000253","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m035-0066","start":66,"end":68,"surface":"桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001647","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m035-0070","start":70,"end":74,"surface":"太子茲甫","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001138","status":"contextual_provisional"